Technobabble

The Windows and Linux editions are independent recreations of Dustin Kirkland's
Hollywood. The application source is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
Earlier Windows releases used the name Hollywood for Windows.

Upstream Hollywood
  Copyright 2014-2026 Dustin Kirkland <dustin.kirkland@gmail.com>
  https://github.com/dustinkirkland/hollywood
  Reference commit b715325107cb3f54f77831c3a9d23adcdfe8de1d
  Apache License 2.0, as stated in the upstream scripts and debian/copyright.

The Windows edition embeds the upstream map.jpg and a sampled atlas derived
from soundwave.mp4. The Linux edition uses resized RGB data derived from the
map and atlas. Detailed asset provenance is in windows/NOTICE.txt and
linux/NOTICE.txt.

